ryline": "In order to pay off your family's' debt, you've relinquished your body to be resurrected as a killing machine. Centuries later, you wake up to a world that is physically broken in half, and a blight of undulating flesh is writhing from its core and overcoming the last remnants of civilization. As the Galvanized, it's all on you to beat back the flesh blight, and protect your city from the encroaching threat. Do you have what it takes, or will you be assimilated like the rest? Blast your way through gritty, brutalist settings and monsters far beyond even your darkest fears. Traverse this forboding terrain with a body of unfeeling steel and superhuman speed. Above all, if you wish to regain your material freedom, leave none of the weaker fleshnoid lifeforms in your wake...", "summary": "A fast paced, movement focused FPS in a foreboding, post-apocalyptic setting.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/galvanized", "videos": [{"id": 106750, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MEAG16WbH6A", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MEAG16WbH6A", "title": "Galvanized 1st Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MEAG16WbH6A/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154227, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "0FwN9Uu25xg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0FwN9Uu25xg", "title": "Galvanized Episode 1 Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0FwN9Uu25xg/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}